{"uid":"145497410efb5017","name":"test_an_oversized_unstaged_task_is_refused_at_ingestion_then_a_staged_resubmission_reaches_plan_review_and_the_run_succeeds","fullName":"tests.flows.test_flow_peer_gates#test_an_oversized_unstaged_task_is_refused_at_ingestion_then_a_staged_resubmission_reaches_plan_review_and_the_run_succeeds","historyId":"cc6645b579d777b996af93c42f03efc8","time":{"start":1791938123802,"stop":1791938125531,"duration":1729},"description":"Task 029 (requirement D.2/D.4, #157): the planner's FIRST proposal\n    is one flat task carrying `estimatedIterations: 4` and no staged\n    decomposition -- `plan_ingestion.enforce_plan_ingestion` refuses it\n    (naming task `001` in a `contract.violation` event, before\n    `plan_review` is ever invoked) and re-prompts the SAME planning\n    approach; the stub's second `Role: Planner` invocation (recognising the\n    engine's own \"your previous plan-proposal.json was rejected\" re-prompt\n    text -- `STUB_PLANNING_RETRY_TASKS_JSON`) resubmits a genuinely staged\n    proposal: the same oversized parent beside two dependency-chained\n    `Stage N` tasks with their own measurable criteria. Ingestion accepts\n    that one, `plan_review`'s single invocation approves it (no objection\n    knob set), and the three tasks run to completion.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 029 (requirement D.2/D.4, #157): the planner's FIRST proposal<br />\nis one flat task carrying <code>estimatedIterations: 4</code> and no staged<br />\ndecomposition -- <code>plan_ingestion.enforce_plan_ingestion</code> refuses it<br />\n(naming task <code>001</code> in a <code>contract.violation</code> event, before<br />\n<code>plan_review</code> is ever invoked) and re-prompts the SAME planning<br />\napproach; the stub's second <code>Role: Planner</code> invocation (recognising the<br />\nengine's own &quot;your previous plan-proposal.json was rejected&quot; re-prompt<br />\ntext -- <code>STUB_PLANNING_RETRY_TASKS_JSON</code>) resubmits a genuinely staged<br />\nproposal: the same oversized parent beside two dependency-chained<br />\n<code>Stage N</code> tasks with their own measurable criteria. Ingestion accepts<br />\nthat one, <code>plan_review</code>'s single invocation approves it (no objection<br />\nknob set), and the three tasks run to completion.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791937657212,"stop":1791937657213,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791937657213,"stop":1791937657213,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791938123754,"stop":1791938123754,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791938123755,"stop":1791938123776,"duration":21},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791938123776,"stop":1791938123777,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791938123777,"stop":1791938123789,"duration":12},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":fals